two-step invariant (t î = u î ∧ t(succ î) = u(succ î)); the step uses only that
t(i+2) is adjacent to u(i+1), that u(i+2) = d(u(i+1)) and u(i) = dback(u(i+1)),
and t injective. Listing = powers ++ (powers ∘ σ) (`powersSequenceExists`,
